---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Deposit / Reservation Policy | Alliance K9"
  description="Alliance K9 deposit and reservation policy overview for working-line puppy placement."
>
  <Section
    eyebrow="Deposit Policy"
    title="Deposit / Reservation Policy"
    headingLevel="h1"
    description="Deposits help confirm serious interest, but puppy placement remains based on long-term fit, temperament, buyer goals, and responsible matching."
  >
    <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone">
      <p>
        Submitting an application does not guarantee placement. Alliance K9 reviews each application with the goal of matching the right puppy to the right home.
      </p>
      <p>
        A deposit may secure placement order or a selected puppy once fit and availability have been discussed. Placement is based on the puppy's temperament, the buyer's goals, household environment, experience level, and willingness to provide structure and training.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alliance K9 may decline, delay, or redirect a placement if a match does not appear suitable for the puppy or buyer. Exact refundability terms should be confirmed directly with Alliance K9 before submitting a deposit.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
